    "title": "otosora v0.6.1",
    "notes": "# Otosora 0.6.1\n\n## Fixes\n- Play, pause, next and previous in the notification, on the lock screen and on headsets work again after a song fails to load. Before, the player stopped responding until a new queue was started.\n- Changing the sky in Background no longer removes your own picture. The sky's colors now tint the picture instead. Use \"Remove picture\" to go back to a plain sky.\n- When YouTube asks for a sign-in on your network, the song stops loading right away and Otosora tells you why. Before, the play button spun for a long time. Downloaded songs still play.\n\n## Visualizer\n- The visualizer now rises from the bottom edge of the screen, behind the title and controls.\n- Five styles to choose from: Bars, Mirror, Wave, Dots and Glow. Open Now playing, then the ⋮ menu, then Visualizer.\n",
